{"3172770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terrorbytes", "steam_appid": 3172770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In the world's most famous maze, you were never the hero. You were lunch.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/6bc986775ddff8fddddb336af0001c33.poster.avif?t=1783722092\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/6bc986775ddff8fddddb336af0001c33.webm?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/6bc986775ddff8fddddb336af0001c33.mp4?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to three friends have been sucked into a haunted arcade machine, and the thing that rules it is hungry. Scavenge pellets to keep your safe room powered. Hide when you hear her coming. And whatever you do - don't let the power run out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PELLETS ARE LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/682d2c61621b34a05b881c88cb7f115d.poster.avif?t=1783722092\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/682d2c61621b34a05b881c88cb7f115d.webm?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/682d2c61621b34a05b881c88cb7f115d.mp4?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pellet you grab keeps the safe room breathing a little longer. Every trip into the maze is a gamble: go deeper for a bigger haul, or play it safe and starve slow. Spend what you survive with on upgrades and gear — from the humble flashlight to the gloriously stupid power washer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SCREAM TOGETHER, DIE ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/23457a63153626a4ddc3d46faebe6ab5.poster.avif?t=1783722092\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/23457a63153626a4ddc3d46faebe6ab5.webm?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/23457a63153626a4ddc3d46faebe6ab5.mp4?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four players, one maze, and a world that reacts to every dumb thing you do. Split up to cover ground or cluster up in terror — either way, somebody's getting chased. Skin-walkers, invisible stalkers, and pocket-dimension horrors are waiting around every corner to turn your best-laid plan into a highlight reel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MS. CROAK-MAN IS ALWAYS HUNGRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was the star of this machine once. Something happened to her. Now she moves through the maze the way she always has — eating everything in her path — except now, everything is you. Learn her patterns. Listen for her. And if you want out of this machine alive, uncover what she's hiding at the heart of the maze.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In the world's most famous maze, you were never the hero. You were lunch.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/6bc986775ddff8fddddb336af0001c33.poster.avif?t=1783722092\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/6bc986775ddff8fddddb336af0001c33.webm?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/6bc986775ddff8fddddb336af0001c33.mp4?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to three friends have been sucked into a haunted arcade machine, and the thing that rules it is hungry. Scavenge pellets to keep your safe room powered. Hide when you hear her coming. And whatever you do - don't let the power run out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PELLETS ARE LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/682d2c61621b34a05b881c88cb7f115d.poster.avif?t=1783722092\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/682d2c61621b34a05b881c88cb7f115d.webm?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/682d2c61621b34a05b881c88cb7f115d.mp4?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pellet you grab keeps the safe room breathing a little longer. Every trip into the maze is a gamble: go deeper for a bigger haul, or play it safe and starve slow. Spend what you survive with on upgrades and gear — from the humble flashlight to the gloriously stupid power washer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SCREAM TOGETHER, DIE ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/23457a63153626a4ddc3d46faebe6ab5.poster.avif?t=1783722092\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/23457a63153626a4ddc3d46faebe6ab5.webm?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/extras/23457a63153626a4ddc3d46faebe6ab5.mp4?t=1783722092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four players, one maze, and a world that reacts to every dumb thing you do. Split up to cover ground or cluster up in terror — either way, somebody's getting chased. Skin-walkers, invisible stalkers, and pocket-dimension horrors are waiting around every corner to turn your best-laid plan into a highlight reel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MS. CROAK-MAN IS ALWAYS HUNGRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was the star of this machine once. Something happened to her. Now she moves through the maze the way she always has — eating everything in her path — except now, everything is you. Learn her patterns. Listen for her. And if you want out of this machine alive, uncover what she's hiding at the heart of the maze.</p>", "short_description": "The ghosts are you. Trapped in a haunted arcade machine with up to 3 friends, you scavenge pellets to keep the safe room alive - while the thing that eats hunts you through the maze. Survive the night, uncover the machine's secrets, and escape.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/6fe47c7f6ab7d9f5bd73f98fe79461e9b818d8c2/header.jpg?t=1783722092", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/36673ea2d80c1cfdf47e85c578e9e1a2a50baeae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783722092", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172770/36673ea2d80c1cfdf47e85c578e9e1a2a50baeae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783722092", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD FX-6300 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2024 Over The Moon Games Inc.", "developers": ["Treetop"], "publishers": ["Over The